          </caption>
          <table style="height: 207px;" border="1" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="20">
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 182.692px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>Restrictive Pulmonary Blood Flow</bold>
</td>
